WEBVTT

00:07:29.528 --> 00:07:31.614
from Klerksdorp, South Africa

00:07:31.614 --> 00:07:33.449
to New Delhi, India,

00:07:33.449 --> 00:07:34.700
to Alpharetta, Georgia.

00:07:35.784 --> 00:07:40.206
If I could break down barriers
in access to music and academic research,

00:07:40.247 --> 00:07:42.458
anyone can do it anywhere.

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:46.462
That's exactly what makes
virtual nonprofits so powerful.

00:07:46.504 --> 00:07:48.672
They transcend geographic boundaries

00:07:48.714 --> 00:07:50.257
and bring opportunities to those

00:07:50.299 --> 00:07:53.135
who would literally never
otherwise have them.

00:07:53.177 --> 00:07:55.638
They're a new way
to find and connect the world

00:07:55.679 --> 00:07:58.307
to a huge source of untapped talent

00:07:58.349 --> 00:08:02.102
and a necessary step to nurturing
the future of these industries.